  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"stuff\" is vague by design; a translation often needs a word for **things**, **belongings**, or **material**, chosen by context.",
    "grammar": "\"stuff\": uncountable, so it takes a singular verb (*this stuff is*) and no **a**; many languages use a plural word for **things** here.",
